{"id":"plymouth","name":"普利茅斯","en":"Plymouth","country":"United Kingdom","lat":50.3714,"lng":-4.1422,"dek":"海军港城，五月花启航之地","history":"普利茅斯的海湾先有铁器时代的小商港，锡从达特穆尔经普利姆河运来，与腓尼基人贸易。罗马时代之后，渔村萨顿逐渐兴旺。1254年萨顿成为集镇，1439年获议会批准设市，名字也改成了普利茅斯。\n\n1620年，五月花号载着清教徒从普利茅斯驶向新大陆，六十六天航程中只死去一人。1815年拿破仑被押往圣赫勒拿岛时，在普利茅斯登上HMS Bellerophon号。1912年泰坦尼克号幸存者在这里上岸。英国内战期间，普利茅斯站在议会一边，被王党围困近四年。\n\n二战中，德文港海军基地成为德军轰炸目标。1941年船坞和市中心被毁，战后由帕特里克·阿伯克龙比主持重建。圣安德鲁教堂门上曾留下一块无名木牌，只写一个拉丁词“Resurgam”——我会再起。今天德文港仍是皇家海军三大基地之一，海军传统延续至今。","culture":"普利茅斯的文化与海紧密相连。市立博物馆和画廊收藏自然史与美术作品，自然史标本超过十五万件。凯瑟琳街的犹太会堂建于1762年，是英语世界现存最古老的阿什肯纳齐犹太会堂。与这座城市有关的画家包括Beryl Cook和Robert Lenkiewicz，作家则有威廉·Crossing。\n\n联合街一个多世纪以来都是夜生活的中心，酒吧、夜总会和音乐厅挤在一条街上。Pavilions于1991年开放，从摇滚到芭蕾都演。Hoe草坪面向海湾，传说德雷克在迎战无敌舰队前曾在此打保龄球。如今人们来这里看海、散步，皇家海军的舰船通常每日可见。","pull":"一块木牌上只写一个词：我会再起。","sights":[{"name":"普利茅斯高地","orig":"Plymouth Hoe","intro":"面向普利茅斯湾的一片大草坪，城市最具标志性的公共空间。传说德雷克在迎战无敌舰队前在此打保龄球。从这里望出去，海湾和常驻的皇家海军舰船尽收眼底，天气好时适合坐着发呆。","img":{"u":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/a/a4/Plymouth_Hoe_from_Mount_Batten_%28crop%29.jpg/960px-Plymouth_Hoe_from_Mount_Batten_%28crop%29.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","w":960,"h":360},"src":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Plymouth_Hoe"},{"name":"斯米顿塔","orig":"Smeaton's Tower","intro":"高地上一座红白相间的灯塔，原立于海上，后来整体迁到岸边。登塔可以俯瞰城市、海湾和远海。四月至十月白天开放，票价几英镑，是理解普利茅斯航海身份的一个具体注脚。","img":{"u":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/5/5d/Smeatons_tower_-_Plymouth_Hoe.jpg/960px-Smeatons_tower_-_Plymouth_Hoe.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","w":960,"h":639},"src":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Smeaton's_Tower"},{"name":"国家海洋水族馆","orig":"National Marine Aquarium","intro":"英国最大的水族馆，位于巴比肯历史区附近。馆内展示从本地海域到热带珊瑚的海洋生态，适合带孩子消磨半天。门票含一年内无限次入场，馆外还有一家鱼餐厅。","img":{"u":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/d/d8/National_Marine_Aquarium_Building.jpg/960px-National_Marine_Aquarium_Building.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","w":960,"h":640},"src":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/National_Marine_Aquarium%2C_Plymouth"},{"name":"巴比肯","orig":"The Barbican","intro":"普利茅斯最老的街区，石板路两侧是酒吧和餐馆。五月花号清教徒出发的纪念台阶就在附近，还有一家号称英国最老的面包房。桥下航道有船经过时，步行桥会旋开，值得停下看一会儿。","img":{"u":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/d/d4/Barbican_Plymouth.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled","w":960,"h":360},"src":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/The_Barbican%2C_Plymouth"},{"name":"五月花台阶","orig":"Mayflower Steps","intro":"纪念1620年清教徒乘五月花号离开普利茅斯前往新大陆的地点。实际台阶是后来建的，但位置靠近当年的登船处。站在这里看海湾，能想象那趟六十六天航程的起点。","img":{"u":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/6/6c/MayflowerSteps.jpg/960px-MayflowerSteps.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","w":960,"h":1297},"src":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Mayflower_Steps"}],"foods":[{"name":"康沃尔馅饼","orig":"Cornish pasty","intro":"酥皮里包着碎牛肉、瑞典萝卜、洋葱和土豆，传统吃法是捏着厚边、从另一端咬。在普利茅斯点单时直接说“pasty”就好。Ivor Dewdney's和Barbican Pasty Company都是本地老选择。","img":{"u":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/3/39/Cornish_Pasty_%28cropped%29.jpeg/960px-Cornish_Pasty_%28cropped%29.jpeg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","w":960,"h":653},"src":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E5%BA%B7%E7%93%A6%E7%88%BE%E9%A4%A1%E9%A4%85"},{"name":"炸鱼薯条","orig":"Fish and chips","intro":"普利茅斯人吃鳕鱼通常只裹面糊炸，配薯条。这座渔港的讽刺之处是，岸边餐馆里真正用本地鲜鱼的不多。想吃得简单实在，找一家外卖店，用纸包着走到海边吃。","img":{"u":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/f/ff/Fish_and_chips_blackpool.jpg/960px-Fish_and_chips_blackpool.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","w":960,"h":636},"src":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E7%82%B8%E9%B1%BC%E8%96%AF%E6%9D%A1"},{"name":"德文郡奶油茶","orig":"Devon cream tea","intro":"司康饼配凝脂奶油和果酱，德文郡的规矩是先抹奶油再抹果酱，和邻郡康沃尔相反。在普利茅斯老城或巴比肯的茶馆里坐下，点一壶茶，就是本地人过下午的方式。","img":{"u":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/0/03/Devonshire_tea.jpg/960px-Devonshire_tea.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","w":960,"h":593},"src":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Cream_tea"},{"name":"德文郡苹果酒","orig":"Devon cider","intro":"德文郡乡村产苹果酒，普利茅斯的酒吧里常能喝到本地或邻近农场的出品。干型、浑浊、带果香，比商业苹果酒更有土味。在联合街或巴比肯找一家老酒吧，点一品脱试试。","img":{"u":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/c/ce/2013-09-08_Apfelwein_im_Gerippten_0%2C25l.jpg/960px-2013-09-08_Apfelwein_im_Gerippten_0%2C25l.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","w":960,"h":1433},"src":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E8%8B%B9%E6%9E%9C%E9%85%92"}],"hero":[{"u":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/7/77/Plymouth_from_Mount_Batten_-_geograph.org.uk_-_1580485.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled","w":1280,"h":728},{"u":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/8/8a/Prysten_House%2C_Finewell_Street%2C_Plymouth_-_geograph.org.uk_-_829280.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled","w":1280,"h":962}],"outline":{"type":"MultiPolygon","coordinates":[[[[-4.2055324,50.3985742],[-4.2046191,50.3967845],[-4.197949,50.3933706],[-4.1988681,50.393436],[-4.1946512,50.3926729],[-4.19294,50.3900455],[-4.1901762,50.3885785],[-4.1882283,50.3838135],[-4.1875008,50.3840613],[-4.1869542,50.3811845],[-4.1869106,50.3820266],[-4.185965,50.3821504],[-4.1846358,50.3776922],[-4.1821956,50.3779197],[-4.1845442,50.3773814],[-4.1825441,50.3769555],[-4.1843474,50.3765322],[-4.1837394,50.3741303],[-4.1849324,50.3710708],[-4.1833588,50.3707531],[-4.1851517,50.3704713],[-4.1830203,50.3704223],[-4.1851765,50.3698157],[-4.1826068,50.3700205],[-4.1851674,50.3693725],[-4.1852407,50.3689466],[-4.1821228,50.3692808],[-4.1853223,50.3684562],[-4.1854653,50.3672093],[-4.1813928,50.3680737],[-4.1846816,50.3669776],[-4.1823185,50.3660068],[-4.1830585,50.3656312],[-4.1791578,50.3648287],[-4.178988,50.